+**Edge Cases:**
+- **Roughness Zero:** If roughness is 0, $\lambda, \mu$ become infinite. Clamp roughness to $10^{-6}$ [G].
+- **Degenerate Covariance:** If covariance is singular, inverse fails. Add small epsilon to diagonal [G].
 
